{"id":8867219865799,"title":"Bright Teal Yellow Softball Comforter Set – Premium Sports Theme","handle":"bright-teal-yellow-softball-comforter-set-premium-sports-theme","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform any bedroom into a vibrant haven for softball enthusiasts with this premium comforter set from Jeminise. Designed for girls, teens, and women who love softball, this bedding set brings a dynamic sports theme to your decor.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Theme:\u003c\/strong\u003e Celebrate your passion for softball with a design that resonates with players, fans, and lovers of the sport.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to fit various bed dimensions.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSuperior Craftsmanship:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features an eco-friendly finishing process that ensures vibrant colors and prevents fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoft \u0026amp; Durable Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, and breathable feel that is more durable than cotton.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e This comforter set is machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low. For best results, wash in a mesh laundry bag.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Each set includes a soft and comfortable comforter to complete your bedding ensemble.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Style:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features a bright teal and yellow color palette with a vibrant softball design, perfect for adding a relaxing and wonderful mood to any room.\u003c\